From e0151d907983ec6d88dfd17d87755c189220b777 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Antti Laakso <antti.laakso@linux.intel.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 14:29:31 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 12/45] media: ipu6: Add ipu7 buttress support

The ipu7 differs from ipu6 e.g. in power management, authentication,
interrupt handling and clock setup. Add support for ipu7 buttress.

Signed-off-by: Antti Laakso <antti.laakso@linux.intel.com>
Signed-off-by: Sakari Ailus <sakari.ailus@linux.intel.com>
---
